@startuml SequenceDiagram_RegisterAdmin
' Sequence Diagram - Register (Complete Registration), Cafe Admin (UC8)
' Plain black-and-white style matching the report's existing sequence
' diagrams (e.g. Manage Users).

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
hide footbox

skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor black
  LifeLineBorderColor black
  LifeLineBackgroundColor white
  ParticipantBorderColor black
  ParticipantBackgroundColor white
  ParticipantFontColor black
  ParticipantFontStyle bold
}

participant "Cafe Admin" as Admin
participant "Flask Server" as Flask
participant "SQLite DB" as DB

Admin -> Flask : 1: Request registration page
Flask --> Admin : 2: Display registration form
Admin -> Flask : 3: Submit Admin ID, password, confirm password
Flask -> DB : 4: Check admin_id exists, active,\npassword_hash IS NULL
DB --> Flask : 5: Return admin record
Flask -> DB : 6: Update password_hash for admin_id
DB --> Flask : 7: Confirm update
Flask --> Admin : 8: Registration complete; redirect to login

@enduml
